      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2756,
        "name": "香辛料",
        "desc": "<p>复合口味的调味剂。由千燥的香辛果加工而成。能为料理赋予多层次的风味，因而坊间有着「万物皆可香辛料」的说法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/23/88072335/7c682e6b10e3bf9552a998c449b67ba5_8251746662651069129.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/05/30/237301566/1b0dedc4ea7fd2a8eeb65af99082ad05_3104622570215064203.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2844,
        "name": "香辛果",
        "desc": "<p><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65)\">生长在炎热潮湿的雨林当中，有着特殊辛香的果实。磨成粉末后可以制成香辛料，是须弥最重要的香料植物。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/09/27/36540823/2ed644daf09a03e0c2aab5267f6088a2_1902023489736671567.png",
        "amount": 2,
