      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 300,
        "name": "兽肉",
        "desc": "兽类的新鲜肉块。经过适当处理可以制成让人元气满满的美食。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Raw Meat_icon.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2713,
        "name": "帕蒂沙兰",
        "desc": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">圣洁而高贵的花卉，对生长环境的要求十分苛刻。花蕊经过加工后可以制成珍贵的香料。</span></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/09/11/7998136/d5172558c50dbc305ee422b95bf8ed21_4672434247374916678.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2756,
        "name": "香辛料",
        "desc": "<p>复合口味的调味剂。由千燥的香辛果加工而成。能为料理赋予多层次的风味，因而坊间有着「万物皆可香辛料」的说法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/23/88072335/7c682e6b10e3bf9552a998c449b67ba5_8251746662651069129.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 999,
        "name": "洋葱",
        "desc": "球状的草本植物。为了报复切碎它的人，不管人的心情好坏都会让他落泪。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Onion_icon.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关料理"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3627,
        "name": "镀金锅",
        "desc": "<p>炖煮而成的肉类菜肴。与众不同的尖帽型锅盖，能减少菜肴在炖煮时的水分流失，是独属于沙漠人的烹饪智慧。这一美味，随着镀金旅团四处奔走而在须弥流行起来也因此得名。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/03/07/88072335/613bbb6f96d1c0a81c1c07beda5846aa_4372798243788871036.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3626,
        "name": "奇怪的镀金锅",
        "desc": "<p>炖煮而成的肉类菜肴。看起来似乎还不错但是一品尝，肉块干巴巴的，给人一种在嚼干柴的错觉。到底是锅盖坏了呢，还是使用方法不对呢？</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/03/07/88072335/b9e0fbfcb5ce09c1f092fcf7c0491de9_4317685071417151796.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3625,
        "name": "美味的镀金锅 ",
        "desc": "<p>炖煮而成的肉类菜肴。大块大块的兽肉，浸润着浓郁汤汁，一轻抿就化在唇齿。独具风味的香辛料配合着肉香的节奏,在味蕾上奏响了一曲来自沙漠的欢歌，舌尖更是不禁为此鼓掌。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/03/07/88072335/166ab918cda91ce52fc05c0882ab9eb1_5106385165396705573.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3621,
        "name": "炽金之锅",
        "desc": "<p>迪希雅的特色料理。打开其貌不扬的锅盖，里面是酥软的肉块，入口后唇齿间尽是惹人迷醉的肉香···看来迪希雅的厨艺和她的实力一样，值得百分百的信赖。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/03/07/88072335/3f765e617a882cca97418ed6e6f79571_7218199957278429648.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "秘香肉团"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关食谱"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3468,
        "name": "食谱：秘香肉团",
        "desc": "<p>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「秘香肉团」的制作方法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/01/25/47826599/60c9c277139b43907167e6452d409874_4977232917222051665.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "需要食材"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3484,
        "name": "神秘的肉",
        "desc": "<p>散发着神秘气息的新鲜肉块。不知道吃起来会是什么味道呢？</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/01/24/47826599/835d61f21cc37bd5f779a4bc901b687f_4499393661505978926.png",
        "amount": 3,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 646,
        "name": "小麦",
        "desc": "金灿灿的穗子，让人充满希望。要经过磨砺与水火才能成为终极形态。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Wheat_icon.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 999,
        "name": "洋葱",
        "desc": "球状的草本植物。为了报复切碎它的人，不管人的心情好坏都会让他落泪。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Onion_icon.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2756,
        "name": "香辛料",
        "desc": "<p>复合口味的调味剂。由千燥的香辛果加工而成。能为料理赋予多层次的风味，因而坊间有着「万物皆可香辛料」的说法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/23/88072335/7c682e6b10e3bf9552a998c449b67ba5_8251746662651069129.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关料理"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3469,
        "name": "秘香肉团",
        "desc": "<p>以肉末为主的菜肴。先将小麦碾碎烹煮，混合碎肉制成表皮，再炒制洋葱和肉作为内馅，最后揉成肉团炸至金黄。只要火候掌控得当，轻而易举就能享受到大口吃肉的幸福。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/01/25/47826599/0a95de77d47e8797e046592d9ff48a95_3110742717898580396.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3470,
        "name": "奇怪的秘香肉团",
        "desc": "<p>以肉末为主的菜肴。黯淡的外表，让人无法想象出里面究竟放了什么。稍稍尝上一口…嗯，看来有小麦，嘴唇很明显是被小麦壳刮了一下。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/01/25/47826599/36ecb6848dda95f9e37379b85cd2e2eb_5012565217790302942.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3471,
        "name": "美味的秘香肉团",
        "desc": "<p>以肉末为主的菜肴。酥脆又带嚼劲的表皮包裹着鲜香可口的内馅，相比普通的肉团更具层次感。仅是吃下一个，迷人的肉香就席卷着幸福感直冲头顶，带来独一无二的曼妙享受。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/01/25/47826599/a446c17005e879b045f07f0506bc982c_1835654736954962241.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "绿汁脆球"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关食谱"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2742,
        "name": "食谱：绿汁脆球",
        "desc": "<p>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「绿汁脆球」的制作方法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/27/88072335/60c9c277139b43907167e6452d409874_3258818831949255353.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "需要食材"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 435,
        "name": "土豆",
        "desc": "块状的草本植物。来自大地的馈赠，是不管怎样加工都永远吃不腻的一味神奇食材。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Potato_icon.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2795,
        "name": "秃秃豆",
        "desc": "<p>提瓦特常见的豆类作物。带有淡淡的香气，因食用方法多样而被各地民众广泛接受。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/26/88072335/1e67f272a1c27d4771c319ff7fc6cd3a_819004033186907061.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2756,
        "name": "香辛料",
        "desc": "<p>复合口味的调味剂。由千燥的香辛果加工而成。能为料理赋予多层次的风味，因而坊间有着「万物皆可香辛料」的说法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/23/88072335/7c682e6b10e3bf9552a998c449b67ba5_8251746662651069129.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关料理"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2770,
        "name": "绿汁脆球",
        "desc": "<p>蘸汁食用的小吃。用热油先炸好脆球，戳个洞塞入配料，搭配绿汁一起食用。大小适中，一口一个，是须弥街头常见的特色小吃。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/27/88072335/9bd070535c53fb42d6d86288248d1abc_3081051800121387763.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2769,
        "name": "奇怪的绿汁脆球",
        "desc": "<p>蘸汁食用的小吃。调配出的绿汁散发着些许不同寻常的微妙气味，颜色似乎也不太对劲…或许放弃掉蘸汁，直接吃脆球会比较好。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/27/88072335/c6e73e93365934f46e3352f1eef0fd00_2044902482639565951.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2768,
        "name": "美味的绿汁脆球",
        "desc": "<p>蘸汁食用的小吃。如同史莱姆一般圆滚滚的脆球，盛着鲜艳神秘的汁水。刚一入口，清凉、刺激、酸爽等多重口味，瞬间在舌尖炸开，带给人如梦似幻般的冲击感。难怪有的须弥人会对此如痴如醉…</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/27/88072335/e71e7408570d9b96f0abb055b135e79c_3985812934362948748.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "咖喱虾"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关食谱"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2737,
        "name": "食谱：咖喱虾",
        "desc": "<p>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「咖喱虾」的制作方法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/27/88072335/60c9c277139b43907167e6452d409874_1472599268541386201.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "需要食材"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1556,
        "name": "虾仁",
        "desc": "饱满的深海虾仁。拥有丰富的营养与压倒性的鲜美风味。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Shrimp Meat_icon.png",
        "amount": 3,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 999,
        "name": "洋葱",
        "desc": "球状的草本植物。为了报复切碎它的人，不管人的心情好坏都会让他落泪。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Onion_icon.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2756,
        "name": "香辛料",
        "desc": "<p>复合口味的调味剂。由千燥的香辛果加工而成。能为料理赋予多层次的风味，因而坊间有着「万物皆可香辛料」的说法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/23/88072335/7c682e6b10e3bf9552a998c449b67ba5_8251746662651069129.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关料理"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2759,
        "name": "咖喱虾",
        "desc": "<p>须弥的家常菜肴。浓香的咖喱与海洋气息相结合，虾肉经炖煮变得弹牙，带着鲜味一并融入到咖喱汤汁之中，令人食欲大开。在须弥几乎每家每户都会做这道菜肴，但味道大相径庭，可以说一千个须弥家庭有一千种咖喱虾。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/27/88072335/987784fd25eb202a09568c6b43b116bb_7290481627523097913.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2758,
        "name": "奇怪的咖喱虾",
        "desc": "<p>须弥的家常菜肴。从浓烈呛鼻的气味中依稀分辨出是咖喱，在糊状物质中好不容易才找出了一只干瘪的虾。是咖喱虾没错…只是如何下口才好呢？</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/27/88072335/9dc48c63efb193219d14c692e7a4d3f6_8760465796961642148.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2757,
        "name": "美味的咖喱虾",
        "desc": "<p>须弥的家常菜肴。醇厚的酱汁浓稠又细腻，丝丝渗入身壮肉硕的大虾中。洋溢满热情的香气，一不留神间便钻入了鼻腔。就算是食不甘味的时节，如此一份菜肴也能令人口水直流了吧。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/27/88072335/4de60e2a87198ea5a8c4dc864ec50a3b_8673402049567181423.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "萨巴桑炸角"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关食谱"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3347,
        "name": "食谱：萨巴桑炸角",
        "desc": "<p>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「萨巴桑炸角」的制作方法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/27/88072335/60c9c277139b43907167e6452d409874_8401863084909473834.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "需要食材"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 300,
        "name": "兽肉",
        "desc": "兽类的新鲜肉块。经过适当处理可以制成让人元气满满的美食。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Raw Meat_icon.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1737,
        "name": "面粉",
        "desc": "由小麦磨成的粉末。无论做成怎样的主食，都能给食客的胃带来片刻充实。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Flour_icon.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2756,
        "name": "香辛料",
        "desc": "<p>复合口味的调味剂。由千燥的香辛果加工而成。能为料理赋予多层次的风味，因而坊间有着「万物皆可香辛料」的说法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/23/88072335/7c682e6b10e3bf9552a998c449b67ba5_8251746662651069129.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关料理"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3344,
        "name": "萨巴桑炸角",
        "desc": "<p>油炸而成的小吃。薄薄的面皮卷上搅拌均匀的内馅，裹成三角状,放入油锅煎到金黄。肉馅与素馅两种都很常见，因此也成为了素食派与肉食派「交战时的必争之地」。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/27/88072335/5eccb2be323308d730be30124531df92_1882894138294200191.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3345,
        "name": "奇怪的萨巴桑炸角",
        "desc": "<p>油炸而成的小吃。油腻的外皮加上浓重到呛人的内馅，就算是搭配清爽的薄荷酱,也让人没有勇气再尝试第二个了。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/27/88072335/44aae404a321d107929234f48cc7ad2e_8853880712333128736.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3346,
        "name": "美味的萨巴桑炸角",
        "desc": "<p>油炸而成的小吃。金黄酥脆的外皮个头饱满，里面包裹着软糯的内馅。第一个，狼吞虎咽；第二个，细细品味…不知不觉间沉醉于味蕾的享受，恍惚中再次伸手，才发现盘内早已空空如也。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/27/88072335/0a14d37254195c12703d147d3fbdc4d8_414025364819442808.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "马萨拉芝士球"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关食谱"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2745,
        "name": "食谱：马萨拉芝士球",
        "desc": "<p>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「马萨拉芝士球」的制作方法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/03/07/88072335/60c9c277139b43907167e6452d409874_9109155385103845925.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "需要食材"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 435,
        "name": "土豆",
        "desc": "块状的草本植物。来自大地的馈赠，是不管怎样加工都永远吃不腻的一味神奇食材。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Potato_icon.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 603,
        "name": "奶酪",
        "desc": "由牛奶浓缩发酵制成的奶制品。提供热量的同时，赋予了烹饪无限可能性。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Cheese_icon.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2756,
        "name": "香辛料",
        "desc": "<p>复合口味的调味剂。由千燥的香辛果加工而成。能为料理赋予多层次的风味，因而坊间有着「万物皆可香辛料」的说法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/23/88072335/7c682e6b10e3bf9552a998c449b67ba5_8251746662651069129.png",
